Hi <%= @mentioned_user.name %>,

<% if @mentioner.present? %>
  <%= @mentioner.name %> mentioned you in a <%= @mentionable.model_name.human.downcase %>:
<% else %>
  Somebody mentioned you in a <%= @mentionable.model_name.human.downcase %>:
<% end %>

<% if @mentionable.is_a?(Story) %>
  <%= @mentionable.title %>: <%= project_story_url(@mentionable.project, @mentionable) %>
<% elsif @mentionable.is_a?(Comment) %>
  Comment on story <%= @mentionable.story.prefix_with_number %>: <%= project_story_url(@mentionable.story.project, @mentionable.story) %>
<% end %>

Thanks,
The Tribely Team
